---
// apps/site/src/pages/index.astro
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { QUESTIONS } from "../data/architecture";
---
<Base
  title="Target-Safety GNN on a Biomedical Knowledge Graph"
  lead="Do the typed relationships in a public biomedical knowledge graph predict
        drug-safety endpoints for protein targets — beyond node popularity, and
        beyond target features that need no graph at all?"
>
  <p>
    The operative word in the brief is <em>whether</em>. This is a feasibility
    question with an admissible negative answer, and the pipeline is built so it
    can return one.
  </p>
  <ul>
    {QUESTIONS.map((q) => <li><strong>{q.id}</strong> — {q.question}</li>)}
  </ul>
  <p><a href="/architecture/">The nine layers, and what fails at each →</a></p>
</Base>
